sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Backend
    participant DB

    Client->>Backend: GET /repos/:id/commits
    Backend->>DB: Query commits
    DB-->>Backend: Commit rows
    Backend-->>Client: 200 Commit timeline

    Client->>Backend: GET /comments?repoId=:id
    Backend->>DB: Query comments + anchors
    DB-->>Backend: Comment rows
    Backend-->>Client: 200 Comment feed

    Client->>Client: Merge + render map with overlays